  "question": {
    "text": "The largest value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi></math>, for which the region represented by the set <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is contained in the region represented by the set <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math>, is equal to :",
    "image": null
